  "description": "A comprehensive .NET 9.0 foundation library implementing Domain-Driven Design (DDD) patterns for enterprise applications. Provides base entity classes with audit functionality, generic Repository pattern, Unit of Work pattern, Entity Framework Core 9.0.7 integration, security utilities with Argon2 1.3.1 hashing, FluentValidation 12.0.0 support, and internationalization resources. Ideal for building scalable, maintainable applications following clean architecture principles.",
